          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qooda kana ch'ufa keesa Musani, shantama ch'ufa keesaa, namafi saale toko fuud'e, akuma AABBO Waaqi isaani jed'e, worra Lawi, ka huji Waaro Woyyuma harkaa qabu, kenne.",
          "type": "text",
